WEBVTT

00:00:01.820 --> 00:00:04.330
The time for conflict has come.

00:00:07.290 --> 00:00:08.240
What's this?

00:00:10.520 --> 00:00:11.830
So you've revealed yourself, Leopard!

00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:13.400
That voice is...

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:15.590
I'm getting bad vibes.

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:17.840
Ner...val.

00:00:18.360 --> 00:00:22.750
How about rejoicing at our reunion, Leopard?

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:31.000
What's going to happen to this area's buildings?

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:32.740
Nerval is over there.

00:00:32.740 --> 00:00:34.220
I'm scared.

00:00:34.220 --> 00:00:35.190
Imo-chan...

00:00:35.190 --> 00:00:36.140
Yes!

00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:38.180
Our Grabfisher is coming now.

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:41.010
What is... Nerval?

00:00:41.010 --> 00:00:42.780
Humanity's enemy.

00:00:43.250 --> 00:00:44.560
Shishidou-san!

00:00:44.560 --> 00:00:46.570
Takane Onee-chan!

00:00:52.330 --> 00:00:56.160
A traction field; that QT-Arms can make one?

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:58.240
Sister!

00:01:01.740 --> 00:01:02.460
Sister!

00:01:02.460 --> 00:01:03.200
Shishidou-san!

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:04.510
Takane Onee-chan!!

00:01:12.810 --> 00:01:17.150
For you to show yourself first, you must've had time.

00:01:18.430 --> 00:01:22.650
I don't know anyone as repulsive as you.

00:01:23.210 --> 00:01:27.830
Well that's to be expected. I lost my body when you betrayed us.

00:01:28.780 --> 00:01:31.640
What!? Are you Nerval?

00:01:31.640 --> 00:01:33.910
Be shocked, Leopard.

00:01:33.910 --> 00:01:38.290
This ugly body is proof of your true intentions.

00:01:43.120 --> 00:01:45.720
To the right. Mister... to the right!

00:01:45.230 --> 00:01:46.350
My friends.

00:01:46.380 --> 00:01:47.580
My friends.

00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:49.540
Takane Onee-chan is in that thing?

00:01:49.540 --> 00:01:54.010
I don't really get all this... but I need to save my sister!

00:01:54.010 --> 00:01:55.490
Sakura, stay here!

00:01:56.340 --> 00:01:58.160
Ojou-sama, wait for me!

00:01:58.160 --> 00:01:59.820
Ah, Imo-chan, you shouldn't-

00:02:01.370 --> 00:02:03.360
Excited "Boom-Boom" and "Nel-Nel"?

00:02:12.030 --> 00:02:14.180
The others came out in their QT-Arms.

00:02:14.180 --> 00:02:16.280
Let's also head out. Ul!

00:02:16.280 --> 00:02:18.170
Really... There's no helping it.

00:02:35.680 --> 00:02:40.010
Flying through space, freely, gracefully

00:02:39.410 --> 00:02:43.710
On the shoulders and in the heart, the girl has wings

00:02:43.110 --> 00:02:47.400
The world she was born into is beautiful

00:02:46.800 --> 00:02:51.050
Even a goddess cannot rule

00:02:54.190 --> 00:02:58.460
That dream on a star born in darkness,

00:02:57.860 --> 00:03:01.360
it won't shine by just watching.

00:03:01.550 --> 00:03:05.820
My body becomes a spaceship,

00:03:05.220 --> 00:03:09.080
and climbs to the atmosphere of my thoughts

00:03:08.950 --> 00:03:23.840
If I try to resign to calmness, my heart will bug up.

00:03:23.500 --> 00:03:27.560
Hey, with your rocket,

00:03:27.170 --> 00:03:31.000
can you change my path?

00:03:30.870 --> 00:03:34.930
By being connected together, we confirm

00:03:34.570 --> 00:03:40.470
we aren't androids

00:03:40.330 --> 00:03:44.420
Across the rainbow, to the future to someone

00:03:44.030 --> 00:03:48.140
If wishing will get me there, I will gradually start believing

00:03:47.720 --> 00:03:51.800
The world we march into is limitless

00:03:51.410 --> 00:03:55.470
Even God cannot destroy it all

00:03:55.140 --> 00:04:00.610
And one day even the sins people made will disappear

00:04:03.060 --> 00:04:06.870
Battle of the Gods

00:04:07.570 --> 00:04:09.850
We cannot establish a connection with Headquarters.

00:04:09.850 --> 00:04:13.020
Please relay to Headquarters that there's an emergency here...

00:04:13.020 --> 00:04:15.570
This kind of message keeps coming from there.

00:04:13.490 --> 00:04:16.830
TS: "The fight of gods"
To those on patrol, units 37 to 87

00:04:15.570 --> 00:04:19.240
But for a correctional center riot, they've made a big fuss.

00:04:19.240 --> 00:04:23.920
The moon government is really prone to panic attacks.

00:04:23.920 --> 00:04:27.220
I guess we'll have to call the police with lunar authority.

00:04:27.220 --> 00:04:31.310
If we don't, those freed criminals will capture it as a hideout.

00:04:32.110 --> 00:04:36.510
To that Grabfisher, all flights to the moon are currently prohibited.

00:04:36.510 --> 00:04:38.110
Please alter your coordinates.

00:04:38.540 --> 00:04:41.260
We're on special investigation. We're with Public Safety at ICP.

00:04:41.260 --> 00:04:42.490
We're higher up!

00:04:50.220 --> 00:04:52.870
The hell is this?!

00:04:55.160 --> 00:04:57.630
Min-chan. Over there.

00:05:00.870 --> 00:05:02.190
That's Kannagi's...

00:05:02.190 --> 00:05:05.720
I have no obligation to be happy to be caught by you!

00:05:08.430 --> 00:05:09.800
Begin attack!

00:05:16.170 --> 00:05:19.760
Relying on your drones to attack. You never change, do you, Leopard?

00:05:19.760 --> 00:05:21.410
Take this!

00:05:22.010 --> 00:05:25.110
Sonic Suplex!

00:05:59.090 --> 00:06:01.610
I'm going to be killed again...

00:06:07.110 --> 00:06:08.520
It's freezing.

00:06:08.520 --> 00:06:10.140
It's not normal ice.

00:06:10.630 --> 00:06:11.320
Itsuki-chan!

00:06:13.880 --> 00:06:15.140
We finally caught you!

00:06:15.140 --> 00:06:16.650
You two are...

00:06:16.650 --> 00:06:19.520
Because that colony is there, something will happen.

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:21.950
And where something happens, you're always nearby!

00:06:21.950 --> 00:06:23.920
Just what are you?

00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:27.300
Please don't go blaming me for everything!

00:06:34.290 --> 00:06:35.350
W-What is this?

00:06:36.130 --> 00:06:37.560
Ul! The controls are...

00:06:38.220 --> 00:06:42.520
Unless melted, it completely entraps all material. It'll lock our movement.

00:06:43.160 --> 00:06:45.930
Min-chan, we're frosting up!

00:06:45.930 --> 00:06:48.500
W-Why are we freezing?!

00:07:03.450 --> 00:07:04.880
Itsuki-chan!!

00:07:24.830 --> 00:07:29.980
After breaking it down, The Ka-ching was like that... glitter glitter buguu?

00:07:24.830 --> 00:07:29.980
Based on the quantum interpretation "Nerval is local space," and in contrast to the maldistribution of hydrogen and oxygen molecules, according to the Schuenburg principle, it is established that there is a settlement of water to stabilize isotopically over time.This is the simultaneous Bethanol effect which, coincides to the phase caused by the metastasis phenomenon. With these results, the isotopic stabilization over time is a theory,
which suggests it holds infinite amplification.

00:07:26.460 --> 00:07:30.940
Aiyeee!!!

00:07:31.260 --> 00:07:34.620
Candy? Candy? Candy...

00:08:03.460 --> 00:08:07.520
That cursed figure has finally appeared?

00:08:08.010 --> 00:08:09.460
Nerval, huh?

00:08:09.460 --> 00:08:10.540
Yes.

00:08:10.540 --> 00:08:13.990
It's already on the moon, and has started self-reconstruction.

00:08:17.050 --> 00:08:19.160
The time to fight has arisen.

00:08:19.160 --> 00:08:22.200
The Shishidou clan will rise once again, and fire at humanity's enemies.

00:08:22.580 --> 00:08:27.750
Kazane, I entrust to you all of our clan's resources in order to mobilize.

00:08:28.610 --> 00:08:30.130
Princess Mori.

00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:52.460
I have properly received these powers.

00:08:54.310 --> 00:08:57.200
Control mission begins now!

00:09:00.270 --> 00:09:03.350
Kannagi Itsuki was a Yuki-Onna, after all!

00:09:03.350 --> 00:09:07.140
It really looks like the paranormal department were all Occultists...

00:09:08.750 --> 00:09:10.570
Report your current situation.

00:09:10.570 --> 00:09:12.510
Uh, roger!

00:09:12.510 --> 00:09:17.620
A huge unidentified object, and some troops that seem to be St. Artemis Correctional Center's...

00:09:17.620 --> 00:09:19.890
are having a large scale war...

00:09:20.460 --> 00:09:22.650
What am I saying...

00:09:22.650 --> 00:09:25.500
Pull yourself together, Min-chan! This is real.

00:09:25.500 --> 00:09:28.250
Things have started to become strange.

00:09:28.250 --> 00:09:30.580
Did we put too much pressure on them?

00:09:30.580 --> 00:09:34.360
Something has definitely happened though.

00:09:35.790 --> 00:09:40.070
Relay to the entire Space Defense squadron the information we just received.

00:09:40.070 --> 00:09:40.910
Roger.

00:09:43.280 --> 00:09:44.760
I'm telling you,

00:09:44.760 --> 00:09:49.190
"A huge unidentified object, and some troops that seem to be St. Artemis Correctional Center's...

00:09:49.190 --> 00:09:50.920
are having a huge dispute war..."

00:09:52.300 --> 00:09:54.670
What am I saying...

00:09:55.250 --> 00:09:58.140
Argh! All positions prepare for battle.

00:09:58.140 --> 00:10:00.760
Mobilize the anti-spacecraft defense line.

00:10:07.980 --> 00:10:09.540
Everyone's gathered together.

00:10:11.050 --> 00:10:14.440
Everyone, the elders have given us aid.

00:10:16.820 --> 00:10:18.300
That's Kagura-sama's?

00:10:21.310 --> 00:10:24.520
Let's begin our plan with a direct move.

00:10:32.490 --> 00:10:34.900
Itsuki-chan... Itsuki-chan!

00:10:36.820 --> 00:10:39.090
Shishidou... san?

00:10:39.090 --> 00:10:40.470
Thank heavens, you've come to.

00:10:41.990 --> 00:10:43.850
I've been a burden.

00:10:44.950 --> 00:10:47.220
Don't try to move yet, Itsuki-chan.

00:10:48.550 --> 00:10:51.210
That's Leopard's Golden Gun?

00:10:51.210 --> 00:10:55.220
Then you must be the girl who leapt through space.

00:11:05.060 --> 00:11:07.130
W-What's that?

00:11:14.550 --> 00:11:16.000
Nerval!

00:11:19.760 --> 00:11:24.640
Oh? A survivor from Igjistan? To think they still existed...

00:11:24.640 --> 00:11:26.220
Igjistan?

00:11:27.260 --> 00:11:28.640
Honoka-chan?

00:11:28.640 --> 00:11:29.610
Nerval!

00:11:41.220 --> 00:11:42.630
It's that person from before!

00:11:57.620 --> 00:11:59.060
Takane Onee-chan!

00:11:59.060 --> 00:12:02.130
Leave this to me and go to Leopard!

00:12:02.130 --> 00:12:03.390
Eh?

00:12:03.390 --> 00:12:07.290
The only thing that can defeat Nerval is Leopard's "Soul Shout."

00:12:07.290 --> 00:12:09.560
Why do you know such a...

00:12:09.560 --> 00:12:11.030
Save the details for later!

00:12:27.200 --> 00:12:29.590
Now that I've been freed, you'll try to catch me again, right?

00:12:41.450 --> 00:12:42.170
Ravalon.

00:12:48.290 --> 00:12:51.190
The vengeance waits for the Moon's business.

00:12:56.770 --> 00:12:59.540
For the approaching tryst with the Weeping Fangs.

00:13:12.290 --> 00:13:15.600
Just who in the world is your sister?

00:13:15.600 --> 00:13:17.040
That's something I want to know.

00:13:17.040 --> 00:13:21.430
Geez, I'll make sure I get this sorted out properly afterwards!

00:13:25.220 --> 00:13:28.250
Leopard, break free and get away from that thing.

00:13:28.250 --> 00:13:29.690
It's impossible.

00:13:30.100 --> 00:13:33.860
There's not enough light, and my energy isn't...

00:13:35.030 --> 00:13:37.400
Akiha, go back to Leopard, and pull the trigger!

00:13:37.400 --> 00:13:38.780
Eh... Wait!

00:13:42.090 --> 00:13:44.030
I'll also go with Honoka-san!

00:13:44.030 --> 00:13:47.750
Geez, everyone's off on their own.

00:14:10.110 --> 00:14:12.480
Ah... Finally got here.

00:14:13.190 --> 00:14:15.060
Let's hurry up and fire this!

00:14:15.060 --> 00:14:19.070
H-Hey. Don't go thinking I can fire off my cannon like this!

00:14:19.070 --> 00:14:20.020
Eh?

00:14:20.020 --> 00:14:22.280
The golden orbs are... well...

00:14:22.280 --> 00:14:27.610
frozen... and feel very sluggish.

00:14:27.610 --> 00:14:29.280
H-Hey!

00:14:29.280 --> 00:14:30.810
What should we do now, Ojou-sama?

00:14:30.810 --> 00:14:33.410
Hold on! We have to shoot quickly or...

00:14:43.610 --> 00:14:45.090
Akiha-chan...

00:14:45.090 --> 00:14:48.330
Akiha-chan... Akiha-chan!

00:14:48.330 --> 00:14:50.450
Just another five minutes...

00:14:50.450 --> 00:14:53.030
No way! You're too early again.

00:14:53.030 --> 00:14:55.400
What? Too early?

00:14:55.910 --> 00:14:57.480
Hey, it's coming.

00:14:59.270 --> 00:15:02.280
Candy...Candy...Candy...Candy...

00:15:04.520 --> 00:15:06.200
Ane-chii!!!

00:15:12.090 --> 00:15:14.460
Gathering it in a point, focusing it,

00:15:15.100 --> 00:15:17.270
and then firing a circular beam. All we do is gather all our solar energy, right?

00:15:17.270 --> 00:15:17.970
I got it.

00:15:18.570 --> 00:15:21.550
We received Sakura's "inspiration," and the plan was formed.

00:15:22.120 --> 00:15:24.560
We will now begin our defensive actions.

00:15:28.180 --> 00:15:29.440
System all ready.

00:15:29.440 --> 00:15:34.720
With Absolute Breakthrough Control, I am taking control of all systems in Kirkwood.

00:15:34.720 --> 00:15:35.830
Activate!

00:15:39.610 --> 00:15:41.110
I Have Control.

00:16:05.190 --> 00:16:09.060
This wide beam of light... I'm melting. I'm melting!!

00:16:17.260 --> 00:16:18.410
We melted...

00:16:18.410 --> 00:16:21.790
Look, the orbs are back to normal.

00:16:24.360 --> 00:16:27.240
I can fire. I can fire the Leopard Cannon!

00:16:29.030 --> 00:16:30.500
Your energy came back?

00:16:33.320 --> 00:16:34.700
I am revived!

00:16:34.700 --> 00:16:40.130
I, who had been graced with that beam of light, am currently unstoppable!

00:16:44.320 --> 00:16:49.060
My attack will kill you this time, Nerval!

00:16:51.520 --> 00:16:53.440
Hmph. Such impudence.

00:17:00.150 --> 00:17:01.770
What is that?

00:17:01.770 --> 00:17:03.700
If that thing hits us...

00:17:04.110 --> 00:17:06.580
Leopard, move a bit faster!

00:17:07.640 --> 00:17:11.080
For a great thing like me, moving this fast is more than enough...

00:17:13.240 --> 00:17:16.220
Don't worry about such small things.

00:17:16.780 --> 00:17:19.630
This is a small thing? Gee!

00:17:33.100 --> 00:17:34.310
Now's your chance! Akiha!

00:17:34.840 --> 00:17:36.060
Leopard!

00:17:37.330 --> 00:17:42.570
Take this! My Soul Shout!

00:18:08.380 --> 00:18:10.140
The anti-matter cannon...

00:18:19.940 --> 00:18:21.150
We're saved...

00:18:23.330 --> 00:18:25.520
I did it. I did it!

00:18:25.520 --> 00:18:30.750
I overcame the past, and became the greatest in both name and reality!

00:18:31.590 --> 00:18:35.040
You're jumping to conclusions again, aren't you, Leopard?

00:18:44.330 --> 00:18:45.880
What the? What is that?

00:18:46.390 --> 00:18:47.910
That's...

00:18:47.910 --> 00:18:49.890
Another talking colony?!

00:18:51.600 --> 00:18:54.610
It's been a while, Leopard.

00:18:54.610 --> 00:18:58.650
That voice... are you Kusanchip?

00:19:00.360 --> 00:19:07.400
I've become pretty, haven't I? But unfortunately, I'm only here to pick up Nerval-sama today.

00:19:07.800 --> 00:19:10.910
Nerval? Right now he's about...

00:19:13.520 --> 00:19:17.440
It looks like your Soul Shout is still incomplete.

00:19:17.440 --> 00:19:19.120
W-What?!

00:19:19.570 --> 00:19:23.550
Do not haste. We shall cross paths again.

00:19:24.280 --> 00:19:25.990
Don't fire!

00:19:25.990 --> 00:19:31.920
From hereon out it's a world of adults. It's not a place a child can go to.

00:19:31.920 --> 00:19:33.710
Have a good day...

00:19:36.630 --> 00:19:38.010
What did you say?!

00:19:38.010 --> 00:19:41.420
Hey, hag! Get back here! It's on!

00:19:41.420 --> 00:19:42.940
Fight with me!

00:19:43.500 --> 00:19:45.400
All units cease attack.

00:19:45.400 --> 00:19:47.940
Put the situation in code yellow alert.

00:19:48.600 --> 00:19:51.250
Just what is going on?

00:19:52.980 --> 00:19:56.230
Excuse me! I'm late...

00:19:56.230 --> 00:19:57.590
Who are you?

00:19:57.590 --> 00:20:01.550
I'm here representing Lady Shishidou, Emilio Surre.

00:20:01.550 --> 00:20:04.710
Um... I'm sorry about the self introduction.

00:20:06.490 --> 00:20:12.070
About the activation of the "Absolute Control Breakthrough," I'll start explaining shortly.

00:20:18.550 --> 00:20:20.640
Akiha-chii!

00:20:21.550 --> 00:20:24.090
If you have this, the emperor will rejoice.

00:20:24.090 --> 00:20:25.340
What's this?

00:20:25.340 --> 00:20:28.830
It's one of Leopard's parts. The Golden Orb Warmer.

00:20:28.830 --> 00:20:31.890
Ah, we came for this, didn't we...

00:20:31.890 --> 00:20:33.570
Good work!

00:20:34.290 --> 00:20:36.370
I'm glad everyone's safe.

00:20:36.890 --> 00:20:38.740
Takane Onee-chan!

00:20:38.740 --> 00:20:40.220
Oh that's right!

00:20:40.220 --> 00:20:42.080
Hey... about that...

00:20:42.630 --> 00:20:45.540
We'll explain the details at Kirkwood.

00:20:48.580 --> 00:20:50.540
Ah! They're running away.

00:20:50.540 --> 00:20:52.860
We have to write another letter of apology...

00:21:01.950 --> 00:21:03.400
It's all restored now, huh?

00:21:03.400 --> 00:21:06.270
It looks like they mobilized all of Kirkwood for this incident.

00:21:06.810 --> 00:21:09.140
We need to investigate for further information...

00:21:09.140 --> 00:21:10.530
Got it.

00:21:11.410 --> 00:21:15.030
We'll ask Emilio-Sensei for the details.

00:21:24.200 --> 00:21:25.540
It looks like they're here.

00:21:25.540 --> 00:21:25.880
Eh?

00:21:29.830 --> 00:21:30.710
Ah!

00:21:31.380 --> 00:21:34.440
Kazane Onee-chan... and the school chairman?!

00:21:34.440 --> 00:21:36.220
Welcome back, everyone.

00:21:36.960 --> 00:21:38.560
For now, good work.

00:21:39.580 --> 00:21:42.230
Umm... What's going on?

00:21:42.230 --> 00:21:45.230
So... how should I start explaining this...?

00:21:45.990 --> 00:21:49.400
For now, how about a cup of tea?

00:21:49.400 --> 00:21:51.230
Oh, right away!

00:21:52.490 --> 00:21:55.710
You've met Nerval, Akiha-chan?

00:21:55.710 --> 00:21:57.210
Eh? Um...

00:21:57.210 --> 00:21:58.240
Yeah.

00:21:59.100 --> 00:22:03.820
They are our enemy, and therefore, humanity's enemy.

00:22:03.820 --> 00:22:06.220
You're saying the same thing Honoka-chan did.

00:22:06.220 --> 00:22:11.930
To defeat Nerval, a super power military department was given huge privileges.

00:22:11.930 --> 00:22:14.620
That was us, the Shishidou committee.

00:22:14.620 --> 00:22:16.830
What are you saying, Sis?

00:22:16.830 --> 00:22:21.760
And so, with Leopard, you are fated to fight with Nerval.

00:22:22.380 --> 00:22:23.360
Me?

00:22:25.190 --> 00:22:26.300
Me?!

00:22:26.300 --> 00:22:28.530
Me?!

00:22:38.510 --> 00:22:44.210
My heart is on a trip,

00:22:43.970 --> 00:22:50.160
Blooming at the number of stars that no one has seen

00:22:50.250 --> 00:22:55.940
With unstoppable curiosity,

00:22:55.660 --> 00:22:58.460
I want to go with you,

00:22:57.860 --> 00:23:01.550
in a shuttle flying through the past and future

00:23:01.170 --> 00:23:06.690
Advancing forward, don't stop us.

00:23:06.320 --> 00:23:12.900
Trying to change tomorrow is fine, right?

00:23:12.850 --> 00:23:18.430
Go on, with the excited feeling

00:23:18.000 --> 00:23:24.890
you found from the answer found when you were lost.

00:23:24.570 --> 00:23:30.830
Jump from Earth! Encounters are the galaxies' crossroads

00:23:30.430 --> 00:23:36.700
Isn't coincidence's prank pleasant?

00:23:36.330 --> 00:23:39.500
Suddenly jumping boundlessly

00:23:39.230 --> 00:23:42.390
Friends of space

